der\/accentcolor(_:)-37umr","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSHorizontalDivider\/accentColor(_:)-37umr","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Applies an "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"accent color"}]},{"type":"text","text":" on the current view by using the given tokens of colors."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Uses the current color scheme so as to load the suitable color to apply in the end"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSHorizontalDivider":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSHorizontalDivider","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Divider is a UI element that allows to structure the content by visually separating the content zones."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Divider improves readability and content organization without introducing a stronger visual hierarchy like a heading or a container would."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A horizontal Divider is used to separate content laid out one under the other ("},{"code":"VStack","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The divider can be colored using dedicated "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSDividerColor","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" colors."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The thickness (height) is fixed by dedicated token from "},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"OUDSHorizontalDivider","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSHorizontalDivider","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudshorizontaldivider","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSHorizontalDivider"},"doc://OUDSTokensSemantic/doc